efault-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rootwalker_Male_Addon_1_083c5e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rootwalker_Female_Addon_1_7ecd2c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon\">Second Addon</span></h2>\n<p>To obtain the second addon you must 'use' a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Petrified%20Leaf\"><img alt=\"Petrified Leaf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Petrified_Leaf_c2c546.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Petrified%20Leaf\">Petrified Leaf</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rootwalker_Male_Addon_2_c7f070.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rootwalker_Female_Addon_2_f50693.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["podzilla-quest"]}